      <p class="release-intro">
        Fixes for rough edges found while recording the v2.8.0 launch videos. No migrations: upgrade in place from v2.8.0 or v2.8.1.
      </p>

      <div class="change-section">
        <div class="change-type fixed">Fixed</div>
        <ul class="change-list">
          <li>Choosing a value in the Explorer field sidebar, a filter from a table cell or expanded row, or a group of an aggregation result now runs the query, so results never sit stale under a changed query.</li>
          <li>Choosing <strong>No view</strong> returns the Explorer to the source's default columns, widths and sort, and drops the view's filter and time range if you have not edited the query.</li>
          <li>An alert rule's Groups card shows a loading state instead of "No group is firing." while it loads, and the Groups and History cards show load errors with a Retry.</li>
          <li>The sign-in page says "Your session ended. Sign in again." when a session has ended, for example because the same user signed in elsewhere.</li>
          <li>A dashboard says "not found" only when it is missing. Other load failures show <strong>Failed to load</strong> with a Retry.</li>
          <li>Field values on a ClickHouse source answer 400 instead of 500 for a filter the request cannot run, such as an unknown column.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </article>

