        <ul class="change-list">
          <li>Email delivery works with a display-name SMTP From address such as <code>Logchef &lt;logchef@example.com&gt;</code>. Before, strict servers refused every alert, report and test email. The From setting now refuses a value that is not an email address.</li>
          <li>The field sidebar shows values after a LogchefQL aggregation such as <code>level=error | count() by service</code>, counted over the filter in front of the pipe, instead of failing with HTTP 500.</li>
          <li>An expanded Explorer row keeps its Fields/JSON switch and <strong>Show Context</strong> within the visible width, down to phone width. The table header also stays pinned while rows scroll.</li>
